  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place all the stew ingredients in a pot (potatoes in 2 cm cubes, onion and garlic chopped, chilli thinly sliced, ginger grated) and bring to the boil."
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce the heat, cover and cook for 1 hour, or until everything is very soft. Taste and adjust the seasoning."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with lemon wedges, chopped coriander, yoghurt and flatbread."
